WEBVTT

00:00:12.308 --> 00:00:15.670
<v><b>I:</b></v> What do you usually do in the evening after school?

00:00:15.981 --> 00:00:20.275
<v><b>S:</b></v> Um, I usually go to sports practices, and finish homework,

00:00:20.276 --> 00:00:21.880
and have dinner and things.

00:00:30.848 --> 00:00:33.027
<v><b>I:</b></v> What kind of films do you like?

00:00:34.627 --> 00:00:37.497
<v><b>S:</b></v> Normally action movies or comedy.

00:00:37.650 --> 00:00:41.029
<v><b>I:</b></v> Do you usually watch films at home or at the cinema?

00:00:43.003 --> 00:00:43.802
<v><b>S:</b></v> Depends.

00:00:43.803 --> 00:00:46.683
If it’s a good action movie, I like to go out and watch.

00:00:55.986 --> 00:00:57.613
<v><b>I:</b></v> When’s your birthday?

00:00:57.733 --> 00:00:59.920
<v><b>S:</b></v> My birthday is the fifth of April.

00:01:00.858 --> 00:01:03.393
<v><b>I:</b></v> What do you usually do on your birthday?

00:01:04.271 --> 00:01:06.848
<v><b>S:</b></v> Go out for a meal with family and friends.

00:01:15.818 --> 00:01:17.551
<v><b>I:</b></v> Do you drive to work?

00:01:17.883 --> 00:01:18.576
<v><b>K:</b></v> Yes, I do.

00:01:18.977 --> 00:01:21.040
<v><b>I:</b></v> Can you park near where you work?

00:01:21.761 --> 00:01:23.936
<v><b>K:</b></v> Yes, there’s a car park at my office.

00:01:33.055 --> 00:01:35.715
<v><b>I:</b></v> What do you like doing at the weekend?

00:01:35.716 --> 00:01:40.855
<v><b>R:</b></v> Er, I like cycling, walking, um, socializing, cooking.